# The Daimon should have two layers

This solves the potential contradiction.

## Underlying Daimon State

Mechanically derived:

```text
behavior phenotype
signature patterns
career experiences
meta adaptations
high-salience memories
elemental affinities
```

This is grounded.

## Daimon Intelligence

Once manifested, instantiate an AI persona conditioned on that state.

So:

```text
DaimonState
+
career memory
+
behavior phenotype
+
relationship history
↓
DAIMON AI
```

Now Penelope can literally talk to Boris.

But her identity was **earned from history**, rather than authored arbitrarily.

That's the important distinction.

