# What does the Agent AI do?

The Agent is responsible for the **strategic cognition loop**.

Between battles:

```text
observe history
↓
update beliefs
↓
study opponents
↓
reflect on failures
↓
change long-term strategy
↓
propose body evolution
```

Before match:

```text
read baseline
↓
model opponent
↓
simulate possibilities
↓
reason game-theoretically
↓
construct Battle Avatar
```

After match:

```text
prediction errors
↓
causal analysis
↓
memory
↓
opponent-model update
↓
future experiments
```

This is where LLM reasoning is genuinely useful.

