# What does the Battle Avatar do?

Fast control.

No LLM needed.

```text
Observation
↓
policy
↓
Action
```

240 times/sec if required.

Could later be:

```text
behavior tree
utility policy
small neural net
evolved controller
RL policy
```

but it is **compiled from strategic cognition**.

So:

```text
LLM = coach/general
policy = nervous system
```

That's a very useful analogy.

